                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "It\u2019s time for Congress to stop talking about addressing the failures within our broken health care system and start fixing it. \n\nMy and @RepPfluger\u2019s More Affordable Care Act fixes Obamacare and empowers patients. It\u2019s time for us to act. https://t.co/iWCa1urWbU",
